.TH IOPERM 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
ioperm \- changes x86 i/o port permissions; enabling access requires cap_sys_rawio
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/io.h>
.B int ioperm(unsigned long first, unsigned long count, int enable);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes x86 I/O port permissions; enabling access requires CAP_SYS_RAWIO.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ioperm (2)
